  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>&nbsp;be the plane passing through the line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mn>7</mn></mfrac></math> and the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo></math>,</p><p>So, equation of plane is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>7</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>7</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mn>5</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now finding the image<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#947;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp; of the point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;with respect to plane&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>&#947;</mi></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
